 Brazilian president Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva greets supporters in São Paulo after casting his vote yesterday. Photo: Rodrigo Paiva/Getty Images 🇧🇷 Brazilian Sen. Flávio Bolsonaro is challenging the results of yesterday's presidential runoff election, setting the stage for a possible showdown with President Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva. Bolsonaro's legal pathway following Lula's decisive victory is unclear. Get the latest . 🇮🇱 Israelis head to the polls tomorrow in an election that could upend Israeli politics and reset the country's strained relationships abroad. More from Barak Ravid . 📺 Chuck Todd and Chris Cillizza are teaming up with elections website Decision Desk HQ to host a live election night broadcast. More from Sara Fischer . 🕯️ Actor Walter Koenig, best known for his role as Star Trek's Pavel Chekov, died at 90 yesterday of natural causes, his rep announced today. Hollywood Reporter obit . 
 
