 4. 🏟️ 1 for the road: Happy &quot;sports equinox&quot; 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Illustration: Sarah Grillo/Axios Happy equinox, sports fans.

 It's the one time a year when several major leagues — the NFL, MLB, NBA, NHL and WNBA — all have games on the same day. ⚾️ Highlights include: Game 3 of the World Series, with the Milwaukee Brewers holding a 2-0 series lead over the Tampa Bay Rays (8 p.m. ET, Fox) .

 In the WNBA finals, the Atlanta Dream and Golden State Valkyries are tied 2-2 heading into Game 5 (8 p.m., USA/CNBC/Peacock) . How to watch . 

 
 
